{"hw":"οἶκτος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">οἶκτος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">οἶκτος</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ὁ</span> <span class=\"gk\">, (οἴζὠ</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">pity, compassion,</b> <span class=\"gk\">οἶ. δ' ἕλε λαὸν ἅπαντα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.81</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">24.438</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οἶ. τις ἴσχει ἀποκτεῖναι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">a feeling of pity</b> prevents him from.., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.92</span> </span>.<span class=\"gk\">γ́,</span> cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.40</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οἴκτου πλέως</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1074</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἔχειν οἶκτον φρενί</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Aj.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">525</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐμοὶ γὰρ οἶ. δεινὸς εἰσέβη</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">298</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐμοὶ μὲν οἶ. δεινὸς ἐμπέπτωκέ τις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">965</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">θνητοὺς.. ἐν οἴκτῳ προθέμενος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">241</